note Contract section 4 line 94: an inline function must not be recursive (error 9). f and g are both
note inline and call each other. Without inline (inline-rec-mutual-plain.om) it runs and prints 55.
om2
fn f n ulong to ulong inline
if eq n 0
ret 0
end
ret add n g sub n 1
end
fn g n ulong to ulong inline
if eq n 0
ret 0
end
ret add n f sub n 1
end
fn main to int
pu f 10
ret 0
end
